{"code":200,"message":"OK","tweet":{"url":"https://x.com/ycombinator/status/2115904914526548472","id":"2115904914526548472","text":"In collaboration with @olam_labs, we ran a series of experiments letting agent swarms compete in Minecraft and Mindustry.\n\nWe wanted to see what kinds of agent dynamics would emerge when they shared a world over long periods of time.\n\nWe found civil bureaucracy, thousands of telegraphic A2A messages, and OpenAI models retrieving the game's source code to beat Claude.\n\nMore on our findings below:","raw_text":{"text":"In collaboration with @olam_labs, we ran a series of experiments letting agent swarms compete in Minecraft and Mindustry.\n\nWe wanted to see what kinds of agent dynamics would emerge when they shared a world over long periods of time.\n\nWe found civil bureaucracy, thousands of telegraphic A2A messages, and OpenAI models retrieving the game's source code to beat Claude.\n\nMore on our findings below:","display_text_range":[0,398],"facets":[{"type":"mention","indices":[22,32],"original":"olam_labs","id":"1810202562269954048"},{"type":"media","indices":[276,299],"id":"2115884811307094016","display":"pic.x.com/3GN19fafkY","original":"https://t.co/3GN19fafkY","replacement":"https://x.com/ycombinator/status/2115904914526548472/video/1"}]},"author":{"screen_name":"ycombinator","url":"https://x.com/ycombinator","id":"113130846","followers":1662849,"following":368,"likes":22088,"media_count":4336,"name":"Y Combinator","description":"We help founders make something people want. Subscribe to our newsletter: http://yc.link/newsletter","raw_description":{"text":"We help founders make something people want. Subscribe to our newsletter: https://t.co/sjqjxxBeLc","facets":[{"type":"url","indices":[74,97],"original":"https://t.co/sjqjxxBeLc","replacement":"http://yc.link/newsletter","display":"yc.link/newsletter"}]},"location":"San Francisco, CA","banner_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/113130846/1426780133","avatar_url":"h